OL,3,ACyber incident hitting pension and
OL,4,Abenefits systems 'ongoing', No 10 says,
OL,5,Abut no impact on customer data
OL,6,
OL,7,FDowning Street says a cyber incident
OL,8,Faffecting the Department for Work and
OL,9,FPensions (DWP) is "live and ongoing"
OL,11,FThere's currently no suggestion
OL,12,Fpersonal data has been lost, the prime
OL,13,Fminister's official spokesperson says,
OL,14,Fadding "malicious" activity hasn't been
OL,15,Fruled out - read more
OL,17,FThe DWP took pension, universal credit
OL,18,Fand Pip services offline earlier this
OL,19,Fmorning, saying it was a precaution
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
